{
  "_comment": [
    "Marker set of Yu et al. (2023), Sensors 23(22):9040, Figure 1 (lower body and acromions).",
    "labels: landmark name used by the program -> marker label in your C3D files. If your labels differ,",
    "copy this file and change only the right-hand side. Required: ASIS, PSIS, TRO, LFC, MFC, MMA, LMA, MTH,",
    "SAP and HEE of both sides; the others only add markers to the clusters.",
    "clusters: markers fitted together as one rigid segment, in this order. RHJC/LHJC (hip joint centers,",
    "Bell's regression on ASIS and PSIS) and RAJC/LAJC (midpoint of the malleoli) are computed by the program.",
    "carried: markers that move with a segment; only their missing frames are filled from it."
  ],
